  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessory retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control in assuring that we provide only the highest-quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\nFor 2009-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab\nFor 2019-2024 Ram 1500 Classic Crew Cab\nFor 2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 Crew Cab.\nNote: Please ensure these side step bars fit for your Truck before purchase.\nFeatures\nFitment: These\nrunning boards offer tailored compatibility with 2009-2018 Dodge Ram\n1500 Crew Cab (Including 2019-2024 1500 Classic); Compatible with\n2010-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500 Crew Cab with 4 full-size doors\nOff-road Warrior: Beef up your truck with YITAMOTOR 6'' side steps;\nCompared to heavy iron alternatives, our choice of aluminum alloy step\nbar grants the same rock-solid stability (450 lb. capacity) while\nweighing less and boasting standout rust & corrosion protection.\nFunctional Design: Seamless joined ABS plastic tread pairs with powder\ncoated body surface to achieve great UV rays, rust, and slippery\nresistance; Corrosive elements and road debris can't make their way\nunderside the board thanks to the closed end design.\nAround-the-clock Protection: 6-inch generous step pad allows you to\nsafely climb in & out of your vehicle; Featuring bold presence,\nthese assist steps will guard your rocker panels and handle whatever\nlife throws your way.\nEasy Bolt-on Installation: Adjustable sliding rails on the back\nfacilitates easier installation, in most cases no drilling is needed.\nThe no-drill application makes installation possible in less than an\nhour.\nProfessional installation recommended",
